@startuml Sequence Diagram - View Connected Plugins

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "PluginView" as PluginView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

Admin -> PluginView : 1 Open plugins page
activate PluginView
PluginView -> PluginView : 2 Display connected plugins list

PluginView -> ClerkAuth : 3 Request plugins data
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 4 Fetch plugins info
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 5 Retrieve plugins records
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 6 Return plugins data
ClerkAuth -> PluginView : 7 Return plugins info
PluginView -> Admin : 8 Display plugins list

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate PluginView

@enduml
